        {
          "Label": "UNLABELLED",
          "content": "Osteochondrosis of the intermediate cuneiform is a rare entity that may cause foot pain and limping in children. We report a case of osteochondrosis of the intermediate cuneiform in a child who underwent a spontaneous recovery after conservative treatment."
